Error [jet.UnknownFunction]: Nothing named `missing_value` exists here
  --> Tests/UI/comptime_dependency_missing.jet:4:14
    |
  4 | BASE: #run { missing_value() + 1 }
    |              ^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Only functions that have been defined (or built in, like `print` / `panic`) can be called
 Fix: Define it first (fn missing_value() { ... }), or call one that exists
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0102
